title: Embed pictures
description: A whiteboard in a public project as a picture, for a README, addressed by ids so that renaming never breaks one. The addresses public pages had before they shared the members' lead to the readable ones.
color: blue
connects:
  - to: src/lib/whiteboard
    label: draws the picture
    description: The picture is drawn on request from the whiteboard's saved state, so it follows edits within minutes with no change to the README.
